* Krom can also be upgraded at the [[Forge of Potential]] with a [[Black Marble Battle Idol]].

== Notes ==
* The primary attacks are fairly vertical and wide reaching, with the third attack in the combo being more narrow in the horizontal plane.
* The secondary attack is a long reaching thrust that is capable of outreaching most enemies.
* [[Brenna]], found in the Smouldering Tomb dungeon, is equipped with a fiery version of Krom with a fiery explosion instead of the thrust.
* The sword is named after Crom - chief god of Cimmerians from the Conan the Barbarian book series by Robert E. Howard.

